  "details": "While typing \"visibility\" in the Settings search, typing quickly resulted in the Main Menu settings window closing and opening the chatbox instead.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Open Main Menu, go to Settings.\n\n2. Start typing \"visibil\" in the search (and stop).\n\n3. In quick succession: Hold down the Y key to finish typing \"visibility\", press and release the Enter key to start the search, then release the Y key.\n\nIf done correctly, you should see \"visibility\" in the search and search results, the Main Menu settings closes, and the chatbox opens. (It's frustrating.)\n\nExpected result: Keep focus on the search bar after pressing the Enter key, or have a short (1s) period after search where the chatbox can't be opened, or change the chatbox to open when the Y key is pressed instead of released. Or don't allow the chatbox to open at all with the Y key while the Settings is opened.\n\nActual result: The chatbox opens when the Y key is released after releasing Enter key, and the settings window closes.",
